 *      C2-DF           2
 *      E0              7
 *      E1-EC           3
 *      ED              1
 *      EE              3
 *      EF              4
 *      F0              8
 *      F1-F3           6  (6 bits can be stripped)
 *      F4              5  (only 5 can be stripped)
 *      F5-FF           1
